        "textContent": "\n\t\t\tAbstieg in den Wahnsinn\n\t\t\tSurrender to Madness\n\t\t\tRendirse a la locura\n\t\t\tEntrégate a la locura\n\t\t\tSombre dans la folie\n\t\t\tResa alla Pazzia\n\t\t\t怪力乱心\n\t\t\t광기에 굴복하라\n\t\t\tObjęcia szaleństwa\n\t\t\tSubmissão à Loucura\n\t\t\tПолное безумие\n\t\t\tจำนนต่อความบ้าคลั่ง\n\t\t\t疯入膏肓\n\t\t\t獻身瘋狂\n\t\t"
      },
      "184": {
        "present": true,
        "type": "LocString",
        "valueAttributePresent": false,
        "valueAttribute": null,
        "locales": {
          "deDE": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "Zerstört 3 Eurer Manakristalle. Verleiht allen Dienern in Eurem Deck +2/+2."
          },
          "enUS": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "[x]Destroy 3 of your Mana\nCrystals. Give all minions\nin your deck +2/+2."
          },
          "esES": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "[x]Destruye 3 de tus cristales\nde maná. Otorga a todos\nlos esbirros de tu mazo\n+2/+2."
          },
          "esMX": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "Destruye 3 de tus Cristales de maná. Le otorga a todos los esbirros de tu mazo +2/+2."
          },
          "frFR": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "Détruit 3 de vos cristaux de mana. Donne_+2/+2 à tous les serviteurs de votre deck."
          },
          "itIT": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "Distrugge 3 tuoi Cristalli di Mana. +2/+2 ai servitori nel tuo mazzo."
          },
          "jaJP": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "[x]自分のマナクリスタルを\n3個破壊する。自分の\nデッキのミニオン全てに\n+2/+2を付与する。"
          },
          "koKR": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "내 마나 수정을 3개 파괴합니다. 내 덱에 있는 모든 하수인에게 +2/+2를 부여합니다."
          },
          "plPL": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "Zniszcz 3 z twoich kryształów many. Daj wszystkim stronnikom w_twojej talii +2/+2."
          },
          "ptBR": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "Destrua 3 dos seus Cristais de Mana. Conceda +2/+2 a todos os lacaios do seu deck."
          },
          "ruRU": {
